WEBVTT

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.740
<i>Are you concerned about outside?</i>

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.510
In any case, I cannot leave this room, can I?

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.380
<i>Tes.</i>

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:25.580
<i>A Disintegration Wall has been
placed around your room.</i>

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.280
<i>If you touch that wall of light,</i>

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:33.080
<i>it will analyze you and replay
the memory you regret the most</i>

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.690
<i>before devouring you in your sin.</i>

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:39.600
<i>The barrier will let you through
if you deny your memory,</i>

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.760
<i>but it is impossible for one to deny their past sins.</i>

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.980
<i>As such, the wall will disintegrate you.</i>

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:52.820
If I touch the wall now,
wouldn't it make life easier on everyone?

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.540
<i>I'm sorry, but we must distill
the Armor of Deadly Sins from you,</i>

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>so please stay as you are.</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:01.310
Judge.

